# WonderQuest (Agentic Workflow Prototype)

> An interactive learning platform prototype designed to deliver adaptive, contextual hints and structured feedback using GenAI workflow concepts.

## Architecture & System Features
* **Adaptive Hint Escalation:** Structures user progress and hint requests into stateful workflows that dynamically increase hint detailedness based on user needs.
* **Interactive Feedback Loops:** Integrates context-aware user guidance to improve learning outcomes without giving away direct answers upfront.

## Tech Stack
* **UI/UX Design:** Figma
* **Core Concepts:** Agentic Workflow Architecture, Prompt Engineering, LLM Integration

